SUMMARY:SPECIAL EAST LAMPETER TOWNSHIP SEWER AUTHORITY MEETING
DESCRIPTION:EAST LAMPETER SEWER AUTHORITY \nNOTICE OF SPECIAL MEETING \n  \nNotice is hereby given that the Board of the East Lampeter Sewer Authority will hold a special meeting on Wednesday September 23\, 2026 \, beginning at 9:30 a.m.. at the East Lampeter Township Municipal Building\, 2250 Old Philadelphia Pike\, Lancaster\, Pennsylvania 17602 and also by Zoom.  The purpose of the meeting will be to approve payment requisitions to meet grant deadlines. Anyone requiring special accommodation should contact the Township Office at (717) 393-1567 so that appropriate arrangements can be made. \nView this meeting Live on our YouTube Page: https://www.youtube.com/@eastlampetertownship542/streams \nTo participate or comment during the meeting\, please participate via Zoom Meeting ID – https://us06web.zoom.us/launch/jc/86287772099
URL:https://eastlampetertownship.org/event/special-east-lampeter-township-sewer-authority-meeting/
LOCATION:East Lampeter Township Municipal Offices Public Meeting Room\, 2250 Old Philadelphia Pike\, Lancaster\, PA\, 17602\, United States
END:VEVENT
